      "tpd_week": "11",
      "tpd_reading": "<div>\n<div>電力與配電：</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp; ●系統發電輸電配電系統(高低壓與線制)概述</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp; ●電力訊號源(AC DC)種類</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp; ●電力參數計算，電壓、電流、功率(PQS)、功因計算</div>\n\n<div>感測器與電表：</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp; ●傳統類比數位儀表(電壓表、電流表、功率、功因)，感測器(PT、CT)</div>\n\n<div>●智慧電表(功能、接線、參數)</div>\n\n<div>●電子感測器(sensor) (V、I)(元件、規格、轉換、程式)</div>\n\n<div>電力監控技術概說：</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp; ●&nbsp; SCADA介紹與應用&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp; ●&nbsp; IIOT與應用</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp; ● &nbsp;遠端監控系統 Remote monitoring in industrial automation systems (ICP DAS)</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;&nbsp;● &nbsp;Data Acquisition Equipment (ICP DAS)</div>\n</div>\n",
